  "title": "V2X Awarded $100M In National Security Contracts",
  "summary": "RESTON, Va., Feb. 11, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — V2X Inc. (NYSE: VVX) was awarded $100 million in classified contracts during the fourth quarter of 2025 to support a broad range of national security missions for multiple U.S. defense and intelligence agencies. The awards include services and solutions in the areas of cyber operations, special systems integration, unique facility solutions […]",
